Revision history for noid script and Noid module.

1.4.5-0.424-php	Simplified permissions for groups.
	Fixed warning on close of a read-only lmdb database.
	Made databases lmdb and bdb writeable by group.

1.4.4-0.424-php	Improvments of import
	Imported a pdo database in a single transaction.

1.4.3-0.424-php	Fixes for databases lmdb and bdb
	Fixed wrong report when import of a database bdb fails on write.
	Increased default limit of lmdb database to 1 GB.

1.4.2-0.424-php	Fixes for databases and php 8.4
	Fixed the databases lmdb and bdb with php >= 8.4.
	Fixed escape of like patterns in PdoDb for mysql.
	Escaped backslash in patterns "like" of get_range().

1.4.1-0.424-php	Fixes
	Fixed generator of a new database that depended on the process.
	Fixed engine initialization when a storage extension is missing.
	Skipped tests requiring lmdb when the dba extension is unavailable.

1.4.0-0.424-php	Batch management and performance
	Default generator renamed as drand48.
	Added option to specify the generator.
	Added caches and arguments for performance.
	Added methods to mint, bind and fetch multiple keys.
	Improved PerlRandom with native 64 bits computation.

1.3.0-0.424-php	Compatibility with new linux distributions
	Replaced bdb with lmdb.
	Replaced mysql with pdo.
	Add migration tools and tests.
	Added compatibility with phpunit 9.6.

1.2.2-0.424-php	Fixes and compatibility wrap
	Added a wrapper for compatibility with version 1.1.2.
	Fixes some issues and messages.

1.2.1-0.424-php	Composer update
	Updated composer for php version and url.

1.2.0-0.424-php	Improvements
	Removed support of php 5.6 and php 7.0.
	Restructured with namespaced classes.
	Added support of composer and autoloading.
	Added new storages: mysql/mariadb, sqlite, xml.
	Improved tests.
	Checked compatibility for php 7.1 to php 7.4 (phpunit 7.4).
	Fixed deprecation notices.

1.1.2-0.424-php	Fixes.
	Cleaned code.
	Checked compatibility from with phpunit 5.7 for php 5.6 to php 7.4.
	Checked compatibility from with phpunit 6.5 for php 7.0 to php 7.4.
	Checked compatibility from with phpunit 7.4 for php 7.1 to php 7.4.

1.1.1-0.424-php	Fixes.
	Fixed rarely used features.

1.1.0-0.424-php	Enhancements.
	Added support for alphabets until 89 characters.
	Added the command get_note() to get a user note.

1.0.1-0.424-php	Strict port of the Perl script into php.

0.424	Some portability fixes.  Added notes to README file on installation
	of noid and its prerequisites in user space, with addition of a
	step to untaint PERL5LIB (which wasn't getting through).  Noted
	that a future version of noid will have to change the minter
	database directory from NOID to dbnoid due to potential conflicts
	on case-insensitive filesystems (eg, Mac OS).

0.423	Documentation fixes.

0.422	Fixed flock bug.

0.421	Initial release.
